# Where renaming looks (see bundle.naming): of the modules in the output, each that may claim a
# top-level name of a stem, and each that keeps names of one from everything else; and every stem
# either names. Everything is an interned id.
facts

relation claims-stem(module, stem)
relation reserves-stem(module, stem)

# Each stem's bucket: stems are named a bucket at a time.
relation stem-bucket(stem, bucket)
